<title>HUNGARY: SOCCER-MTK WIN HUNGARIAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MTK WIN HUNGARIAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Hungarian soccer cup final second leg played on Wednesday night:</p>
<p>    MTK 2	   BVSC 0</p>
<p>(MTK win 8-0 on aggregate after taking first leg 6-0)</p>
</text>
